  <dt class="definition-list-item-full">About</dt>
  <dd class="definition-list-item-full">Research at the Laboratory of Analytical Computation addresses the science and engineering of automatic computation. Our activities and interests span the entire spectrum from the design of calculating engines to the exploration of the links between symbolic representation and the operations machines can perform. Systems we study manipulate information at least in part by mechanical means and can be destined for numerical, or indeed for symbolic, applications.</dd>
